{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1654732800, "end_date": 1655337599, "month_true_total": 103, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:04:25 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "117025730", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031983506", "personaname": "我的朋友不多", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198031983506/", "num_games_owned": 277, "num_reviews": 103, "playtime_forever": 165, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 165, "last_played": 1641043536, "avatar": "06e7e2a01e7c7d00c16aba769553e0dc6546bd91"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "朋友喊我回去玩L4D2新的第三方地图，玩完不由得感觉反差更强烈了。\n不知道为啥，这游戏感觉射击手感还不如12年前的L4D2……\n又不开放创意工坊，游戏源源不断的新鲜血液也没了，价格还卖的这么贵。\n总体感觉性价比很低，不推荐购买。", "timestamp_created": 1655304799, "timestamp_updated": 1655304799, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.544418573379516602", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "116995754", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024118187", "personaname": "空", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024118187/", "num_games_owned": 104, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 9891, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4762, "last_played": 1771728957, "avatar": "d7b7988e7bc32f8e08ab167acd110bf8783e59af"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "有北美开黑群吗？  被萌新气哭了几乎", "timestamp_created": 1655246834, "timestamp_updated": 1655246834, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.62486034631729126", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "116961992", "author": {"steamid": "76561199182951482", "personaname": "32131", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199182951482/", "num_games_owned": 3, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 27077, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11365, "last_played": 1675592968, "avatar": "604e4bef983817ecfd200ed89e581a12e9dca2f5"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "服务器老炸", "timestamp_created": 1655194315, "timestamp_updated": 1655194315, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523014545440673828", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "116961202", "author": {"steamid": "76561198423186969", "personaname": "鱼鱼鱼鱼鱼", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198423186969/", "num_games_owned": 43, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3369, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2011, "last_played": 1687499589, "avatar": "b84c9296dc4ed8a0fcaa7bac3428842ac6f6ef9e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "价格太高了，作为一个合作游戏，价格定这么高，买的人少，匹配时间过长。还有就是今天出现无法匹配进入游戏的BUG。大意是：被服务器踢出，因为客户端发送了损坏或无效信息（原因2），昨天还玩的好好的。网上也找不到解决方案，普通的方案我都试了，换加速器节点，不用加速器，重启电脑，检测客户端完整性（检测结果是完整的）都没用。\n\n优点：游戏整体还是可以的，打击感很爽，卡牌机制也很有意思（就是对有选择困难症的人不友好，不选也能玩），僵尸挺恐怖，有那种末日户外行动的代入感。\n缺点：对比其它同质量的游戏来说，价格太贵，的价格毁了所有体验，我是傻X。", "timestamp_created": 1655192669, "timestamp_updated": 1655192669, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 80, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.838910341262817383", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid":